# Build context of testrigs/Dockerfile (the repository root): only what the image copies. The rest of the checkout,
# the run folder and the rigs' build output other than the shaded jars stay out.
*
!runner/pyproject.toml
!runner/README.md
!runner/src
!third_party/oidf-conformance-suite
!conformance
!testrigs/inji-certify-api-test/target/apitest-injicertify-*-jar-with-dependencies.jar
!testrigs/inji-certify-api-test/testNgXmlFiles
!testrigs/inji-verify-api-test/target/apitest-injiverify-*-jar-with-dependencies.jar
!testrigs/inji-verify-api-test/testNgXmlFiles
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
